            </Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en"></rdfs:comment>
        <ns3:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A collection of organisms that consists of two or more organisms from at least two species.</ns3:IAO_0000115>
        <ns3:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">Need to add axiom to specify that it has at a mimum members of two different species, but not sure how to specify that. Can&#39;t say &quot;(&#39;has member&#39; only (&#39;member of&#39; min 2 &#39;species as a collection of organisms&#39;))&quot;.</ns3:IAO_0000116>
